{"Title":"An Act authorizing the continued employment of Jerry Shampang as an environmental police officer in the executive office of energy and environmental affairs","BillNumber":"S2691","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"S30","Name":"Senate Committee on Ways and Means","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S30","ResponseDate":"2024-02-26T10:36:22.447"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2023-09-14T16:59:47.4666667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2691/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, Jerry Shampang, an environmental police officer in the executive office of energy and environmental affairs, may continue to serve in that position until he reaches 70 years of age or the date of his retirement or non-reappointment, whichever occurs first. No further deductions shall be made from the regular compensation of Jerry Shampang under chapter 32 of the General Laws for any service performed subsequent to his reaching the age of 65 and, upon retirement, Jerry Shampang shall receive a superannuation retirement allowance equal to the allowance to which he would have been entitled had he retired upon reaching the age of 65.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2691","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2691/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}